## Cheat sheet

```
# 1. create (once, in PC scope) -- config + PC into player/0
POD_combat_create_duel_effect = {
    INITIATOR = .. ATTACKER = .. DEFENDER = ..   # saved scopes
    FATALITY = no|practice|possible|default|always
    FIXED = no  LOCALE = ..  OUTPUT_EVENT = ..
}

# 2. add combatants (saved scopes only!)
POD_combat_duel_add_ally_effect  = { CHARACTER = scope:.. }   # player/1..49
POD_combat_duel_add_enemy_effect = { CHARACTER = scope:.. }   # enemy/0..49, first -> enemy/0

# 3. go live (once, last) -- opens the window, starts round 1
POD_combat_finalize_duel_effect = yes
```

Rules: PC scope | don't re-add the PC | first enemy = enemy/0 and must be
the other principal | saved scopes for all character params, not var-chains
| 50 per team incl. the PC, silent drop past it | build atomically, once |
finalize opens the window | direct launches lose your saved scopes | the
follow-up's `root` is not guaranteed to be the initiator | a mid-fight host
death fires no follow-up at all.
